  "prompt": "For each month from January to December 2025 (order dates are UTC days), show the units Voltmarkt sold and the units sold in the previous calendar month. Every month of 2025 has orders. Only 2025 counts, so January's prev_units is missing. Return three columns, in this order: month (the first day of the month), units and prev_units. Return one row for each month. Any row order is fine.",
